{"3576340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Convallaria", "steam_appid": 3576340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convallaria is a free-to-play, team-based PvPvE shooter set in the near future, blending raid-style PvE challenges with intense PvP survival encounters. Form a three-person squad and fight for survival-and the truth-in a beautiful yet dangerous open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/b7ee867506da6fede021563fc2c075b9.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/b7ee867506da6fede021563fc2c075b9.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/b7ee867506da6fede021563fc2c075b9.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop In and Loot:  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a three-person squad, choose your landing point, and loot weapons and resources. Use your jet dash system for rapid movement—secure better positions, chase targets, or pull back to avoid danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/0ed62cc4076d1b5d4839328f5de37588.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/0ed62cc4076d1b5d4839328f5de37588.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/0ed62cc4076d1b5d4839328f5de37588.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid Challenge:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A raid timer drives the action. When the “Archives” raid portal appears on the map, squads must race to enter it. Those who fail to get in on time will take continuous environmental damage. Inside the raid, boss encounters demand tight teamwork, with their difficulty scaling over time—every fight is intense and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/da06cb9868f474ae26353c8d18c16603.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/da06cb9868f474ae26353c8d18c16603.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/da06cb9868f474ae26353c8d18c16603.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Final Showdown:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teams that clear the raid will gain a significant edge and converge in the final zone, where they clash in a decisive battle to become the last squad standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e2d2d921a55d2ebf46be41baf94788b8.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e2d2d921a55d2ebf46be41baf94788b8.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e2d2d921a55d2ebf46be41baf94788b8.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon &amp; Skill Binding:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features more than 15 distinct weapon types. Players can equip two weapons at a time, and each weapon not only has its own unique feel but also comes with a dedicated active ability. Switching weapons instantly shifts your tactical role—from deploying healing fields to unleashing explosive blasts, your weapon choices define how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/54abe56a52a3aba5d53e8993be420a51.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/54abe56a52a3aba5d53e8993be420a51.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/54abe56a52a3aba5d53e8993be420a51.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game-Gunsmith:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During combat, you can dismantle, craft, and swap weapon attachments at any time, letting you instantly adapt to shifting battle conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e86f41f02f4501ecc0a426211df013a0.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e86f41f02f4501ecc0a426211df013a0.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e86f41f02f4501ecc0a426211df013a0.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Born for Speed: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual cues like character outlines keep the game’s fast-paced jetpack combat clear, fluid, and easy to read—even during full 3D aerial movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/035aa2509674a67e73080ef7a7534c31.avif?t=1766766389\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras_big/035aa2509674a67e73080ef7a7534c31.avif?t=1766766389 width=1560 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldbuilding:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Raid map is a colossal “Archive,” blending real-world ruins with imaginative, otherworldly structures to create a surreal space that feels both familiar and uncanny. But beneath this beauty, deadly monsters and rival squads lie in wait, ready to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Battlefield:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular seasonal updates will introduce new features and expand your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons, skills, skins, raids, and challenging boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper Lore Discovery:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the deeper lore and larger narrative hidden behind the massive “Archives”，reveals more of the Convallaria world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome you to share your gameplay impressions and feedback in the discussions.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convallaria is a free-to-play, team-based PvPvE shooter set in the near future, blending raid-style PvE challenges with intense PvP survival encounters. Form a three-person squad and fight for survival-and the truth-in a beautiful yet dangerous open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/b7ee867506da6fede021563fc2c075b9.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/b7ee867506da6fede021563fc2c075b9.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/b7ee867506da6fede021563fc2c075b9.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop In and Loot:  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a three-person squad, choose your landing point, and loot weapons and resources. Use your jet dash system for rapid movement—secure better positions, chase targets, or pull back to avoid danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/0ed62cc4076d1b5d4839328f5de37588.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/0ed62cc4076d1b5d4839328f5de37588.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/0ed62cc4076d1b5d4839328f5de37588.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raid Challenge:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A raid timer drives the action. When the “Archives” raid portal appears on the map, squads must race to enter it. Those who fail to get in on time will take continuous environmental damage. Inside the raid, boss encounters demand tight teamwork, with their difficulty scaling over time—every fight is intense and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/da06cb9868f474ae26353c8d18c16603.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/da06cb9868f474ae26353c8d18c16603.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/da06cb9868f474ae26353c8d18c16603.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Final Showdown:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teams that clear the raid will gain a significant edge and converge in the final zone, where they clash in a decisive battle to become the last squad standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e2d2d921a55d2ebf46be41baf94788b8.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e2d2d921a55d2ebf46be41baf94788b8.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e2d2d921a55d2ebf46be41baf94788b8.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon &amp; Skill Binding:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features more than 15 distinct weapon types. Players can equip two weapons at a time, and each weapon not only has its own unique feel but also comes with a dedicated active ability. Switching weapons instantly shifts your tactical role—from deploying healing fields to unleashing explosive blasts, your weapon choices define how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/54abe56a52a3aba5d53e8993be420a51.poster.avif?t=1766766389\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/54abe56a52a3aba5d53e8993be420a51.webm?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/54abe56a52a3aba5d53e8993be420a51.mp4?t=1766766389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game-Gunsmith:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During combat, you can dismantle, craft, and swap weapon attachments at any time, letting you instantly adapt to shifting battle conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/extras/e86f41f02f4501ecc0a426211df013a0.poster.avif?t=1766766389\"