re of the Convallaria world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome you to share your gameplay impressions and feedback in the discussions.</p>", "short_description": "In the year 2082, the world is shattered. Convallaria is the last sanctuary. In this free-to-play PVPVE shooter, form a Squad and raid the &quot;Archives.&quot; Battle monsters, loot gear, and mod Weapons in real-time. The real threat? Other players. Engage in high-paced combat to become the sole victor.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/7ecf305b314bef3a70b3bd965cdb9953bdfac278/header.jpg?t=1766766389", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/eda960257ef34f312c96910964c84d011b0a9ebe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766766389", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576340/eda960257ef34f312c96910964c84d011b0a9ebe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766766389", "website": "http://www.loongforce.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400 or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 , AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 3700X or Intel Core i7- 6700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 6600XT , NVIDIA GeForce RT